# Endpoint Quick Tests

## Health
```bash
curl -s http://localhost:8000/health | jq
# Expect: {"status":"healthy", "services":{"redis":"connected", ...}}
```

## Metrics

```bash
curl -s http://localhost:8000/metrics | head
# Expect Prometheus text exposition format
```

## Orders webhook (idempotent)

```bash
curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8000/webhooks/orders \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' \
  -d '{"order_id":"ord_123","user_email":"u@example.com","plan":"pro"}' | jq
# 200 on first; 409 or 200(idempotent) on repeated with no side effects.
```
